And he refused to divorce me.

122
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:03,399
I had no choice but to take the kids away.

123
00:05:03,639 --> 00:05:04,439
But I...

124
00:05:05,079 --> 00:05:06,000
But I was worried

125
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,319
that the money I worked so hard to make

126
00:05:08,839 --> 00:05:11,839
