127
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:16,040
So I put it in their second aunt's card.

128
00:05:16,519 --> 00:05:17,360
If you...

129
00:05:17,759 --> 00:05:19,639
If you don't believe me,

130
00:05:19,959 --> 00:05:21,839
