131
00:05:21,839 --> 00:05:23,720
Check the transaction records on that card.

132
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:25,160
Every month,

133
00:05:25,279 --> 00:05:27,439
I transferred the money there to save up.

134
00:05:33,519 --> 00:05:35,199
Gu Yan, what do you think?

135
00:05:35,879 --> 00:05:37,439
About the nanny seeing Wu Qimeng today?

136
00:05:38,399 --> 00:05:39,959
From her body language

137
