144
00:05:51,319 --> 00:05:52,839
But the nanny wasn't lying.

145
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:56,439
Unless that person was...

146
00:05:58,399 --> 00:06:00,040
The next one to interrogate is Wang Lili.

147
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:09,480
Wang Lili and Wu Qimeng grew up together.

148
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:11,160
Their family backgrounds were similar,

149
00:06:11,519 --> 00:06:12,360
