Wang Lili has had plenty of boyfriends,

151
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:16,079
but she's still unmarried.

152
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:19,600
The info I gathered is about the same.

153
00:06:20,279 --> 00:06:21,120
Only people often

154
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,160
compared the two of them.

155
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:23,600
And basically,

156
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:25,360
Wu Qimeng always came out on top.

157
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:26,959
Wang Lili's friend mentioned

158
