162
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:34,879
Dating someone isn't an issue.

163
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:37,319
The question is who she's dating.

164
00:06:38,199 --> 00:06:38,800
Wait.

165
00:06:39,279 --> 00:06:40,240
Where on earth did you get

166
