I was more devastated than anyone.

188
00:07:36,439 --> 00:07:37,920
How could I ever harm her?

189
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:39,000
You were jealous of her.

190
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:41,480
Jealous she was better than you growing up,

191
00:07:41,480 --> 00:07:42,519
