198
00:07:53,560 --> 00:07:54,000
Fine.

199
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:55,519
Let's talk evidence.

200
00:07:56,399 --> 00:07:57,199
Then tell me,

201
00:07:57,720 --> 00:08:00,079
