202
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:06,360
We're best friends.

203
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:06,639
I went to check on how she was feeling,

204
00:08:06,639 --> 00:08:08,120
I went to check on how she was feeling,

205
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:10,079
and brought tonics to nourish her body.

206
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:11,439
Wang Lili has currently

207
00:08:11,439 --> 00:08:13,040
