During the interrogation,

209
00:08:14,959 --> 00:08:16,680
she kept staring straight into Yan's eyes,

210
00:08:16,959 --> 00:08:17,839
desperately wanting Yan

211
00:08:17,839 --> 00:08:19,439
to believe everything she said.

212
00:08:21,399 --> 00:08:22,720
You've learned well from me,

213
00:08:23,399 --> 00:08:25,160
