214
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:27,120
Are you sure that when you went to see her,

215
00:08:27,839 --> 00:08:29,720
she was standing alive before you?

216
00:08:30,839 --> 00:08:31,839
Or rather...

217
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:32,960
did you just go to that room

218
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:34,320
where her body was kept

219
00:08:34,919 --> 00:08:36,120
