220
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:46,519
Looks like I was right.

221
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:48,519
Wang Lili turned off the AC at night.

222
00:08:49,039 --> 00:08:49,639
That way,

223
00:08:50,279 --> 00:08:51,480
when the nanny reported it in the morning,

224
00:08:51,679 --> 00:08:52,759
the room temperature

225
00:08:53,279 --> 00:08:54,360
would match that day's

226
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:55,360
around 30 degrees Celsius.

227
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:56,879
As a result,

228
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:58,919
Wu Qimeng's actual time of death

229
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:02,039
would be off by several hours.

230
00:09:02,360 --> 00:09:03,320
That discrepancy

231
00:09:04,039 --> 00:09:05,279
was enough for the real killer

232
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:06,600
to get away scot-free.

233
00:09:06,919 --> 00:09:08,559
She was still alive when I went!

234
00:09:08,919 --> 00:09:10,399
She even talked and chatted with me!

235
00:09:10,679 --> 00:09:12,519
Besides, at eight forty,

236
00:09:12,519 --> 00:09:13,919
