237
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:16,279
I had already left by then!

238
00:09:17,039 --> 00:09:18,159
Since you had already left,

239
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:19,879
how do you know

240
00:09:19,879 --> 00:09:21,679
she texted the courier at eight forty?

241
00:09:21,919 --> 00:09:22,759
That piece of evidence

242
00:09:22,759 --> 00:09:24,519
was never made public.

243
00:09:25,559 --> 00:09:26,360
Unless...

244
00:09:26,679 --> 00:09:28,480
you scheduled that text yourself.

245
00:09:37,759 --> 00:09:38,759
At this point,

246
00:09:39,639 --> 00:09:40,639
what are you still arguing for?

247
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:42,360
Get ready for prison.

248
00:09:49,759 --> 00:09:50,679
I'm pregnant!

249
00:09:52,399 --> 00:09:53,799
I won't go to prison!

250
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:56,279
You think being pregnant

251
00:09:56,279 --> 00:09:57,720
lets you escape going to prison?

252
00:09:58,600 --> 00:09:59,799
Once you give birth,

253
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:01,559
