254
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:04,600
So this was why they murdered her.

255
00:10:05,159 --> 00:10:06,840
The best friend and the husband had an affair,

256
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:09,600
plotting to kill her and her unborn child,

257
00:10:10,519 --> 00:10:13,399
while planning to walk away scot-free

258
00:10:13,919 --> 00:10:15,600
and start a brand-new life.

259
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:26,399
You think he really loves you?

260
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:27,879
A man who, just to be with you,

261
00:10:28,679 --> 00:10:30,080
dared to murder his own wife

262
00:10:30,519 --> 00:10:32,279
and his unborn child...

263
00:10:32,759 --> 00:10:34,440
will one day, for someone else,

264
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:39,279
kill you

265
00:10:39,559 --> 00:10:41,039
and your child.

266
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,320
It was already eight when I got there.

267
00:10:51,519 --> 00:10:52,759
I don't know anything.

268
00:10:52,759 --> 00:10:54,000
I didn't kill anyone.

269
00:10:54,360 --> 00:10:55,600
If you want to convict me,

270
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:57,240
