277
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:11,519
They only see competence and looks,

278
00:11:12,039 --> 00:11:13,080
while ignoring character.

279
00:11:13,799 --> 00:11:15,279
Wang Lili has envied Wu Qimeng since childhood.

280
00:11:16,240 --> 00:11:17,399
Rather than doing it for love,

281
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:18,399
it's more that

282
00:11:18,440 --> 00:11:19,639
she enjoys

283
00:11:20,399 --> 00:11:22,679
the superiority of stealing Wu Qimeng's happiness.

284
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:24,799
We can now confirm that

285
00:11:24,799 --> 00:11:26,360
Wu Qimeng's time of death

286
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:28,080
was definitely not eight o'clock at night.

287
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:30,120
Is it possible that Li Changyu

288
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:31,879
manipulated Wang Lili

289
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:33,279
into merely turning off the AC,

290
00:11:33,919 --> 00:11:35,440
without being part of the murder?

291
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:37,480
I gave you too much credit.

292
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:39,080
If Wang Lili was never there,

293
00:11:39,559 --> 00:11:40,279
then who do you think

294
00:11:41,120 --> 00:11:42,200
the person the nanny saw that afternoon

295
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:44,519
could have been?

296
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,720
Did you see Wu Qimeng's face?

297
00:11:48,159 --> 00:11:51,120
I only saw her back the whole time.

298
00:11:51,919 --> 00:11:52,919
The nanny saw someone,

299
00:11:53,919 --> 00:11:54,960
but didn't see the face.

300
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:57,639
By that time,

301
00:11:58,799 --> 00:12:00,360
Wu Qimeng was likely already dead.

302
00:12:00,960 --> 00:12:02,600
Who impersonated her?

303
00:12:04,919 --> 00:12:06,080
Why do I feel so cold?

304
00:12:07,279 --> 00:12:08,960
I've got chills and goosebumps all over.

305
00:12:09,519 --> 00:12:11,559
I need to take a breather and calm down.

306
00:12:14,759 --> 00:12:15,759
Here, take this.

307
00:12:16,759 --> 00:12:18,159
Interrogations take a toll on your voice too.

308
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:19,240
As it stands,

309
00:12:19,679 --> 00:12:20,840
this is the biggest question mark

310
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:22,399
in the case so far.

311
00:12:23,799 --> 00:12:25,279
If Wang Lili impersonated her,

312
00:12:25,759 --> 00:12:26,919
why is there still

313
00:12:27,799 --> 00:12:29,879
no surveillance footage of her entering or leaving?

314
00:12:35,919 --> 00:12:36,759
I need to personally go fetch

315
00:12:36,759 --> 00:12:37,960
the files from Li Changyu's company.

316
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:38,919
Okay.

317
00:12:39,200 --> 00:12:40,720
I'll interrogate Li Changyu first.

318
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:41,720
Get back as soon as you can.

319
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:43,799
Understood.

320
00:12:45,679 --> 00:12:46,840
Without solid evidence,

321
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:48,279
he and Wang Lili

322
00:12:48,919 --> 00:12:50,480
will be the toughest to crack today.

323
00:12:57,159 --> 00:12:58,879
Didn't you already question me?

324
00:12:59,279 --> 00:13:00,960
Why haven't you caught the killer yet?

325
00:13:01,039 --> 00:13:02,279
Instead, you keep grilling me,

326
00:13:02,279 --> 00:13:02,919
the victim's family, over and over!

327
00:13:03,279 --> 00:13:04,120
Mr. Li,

328
00:13:04,559 --> 00:13:05,720
we understand your deep grief

329
00:13:05,720 --> 00:13:06,759
over the passing of your wife.

330
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:08,440
But we still have some questions

331
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:09,120
that are critical,

332
00:13:09,480 --> 00:13:10,559
which we need to ask you,

333
00:13:10,879 --> 00:13:12,000
and only you.

334
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:16,559
What questions?

335
00:13:17,879 --> 00:13:19,639
Wasn't setting your bedroom AC

336
00:13:19,639 --> 00:13:21,279
to 25 or 26 degrees enough?

337
00:13:21,759 --> 00:13:22,879
Why turn it down to 16?

338
00:13:25,519 --> 00:13:26,399
16 degrees?

339
00:13:27,039 --> 00:13:28,039
My wife was pregnant.

340
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:29,840
We never set it that low.

341
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:30,720
Wait,

342
00:13:31,399 --> 00:13:32,720
what does this have to do with her death?

343
00:13:33,399 --> 00:13:35,000
Something was wrong with your AC.

344
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:36,600
You probably didn't know, did you?

345
00:13:39,440 --> 00:13:41,120
This is refrigerant leaking from the AC.

346
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:43,240
The lower the AC temperature is set,

347
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:44,639
the more condensation drips down.

348
00:13:44,879 --> 00:13:45,879
A few hours

349
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:47,120
was enough to form

350
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:48,480
a large dried stain on the floor.

351
00:13:49,639 --> 00:13:50,840
Fortunately, when the nanny arrived

352
00:13:50,840 --> 00:13:51,840
for work the next day, she called the police,

353
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:53,519
before anyone had time to clean it up.

354
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:57,080
What are you getting at?

355
00:13:58,240 --> 00:13:59,879
A smart man like you knows exactly what I mean.

356
00:14:02,480 --> 00:14:03,120
It was you

357
00:14:03,559 --> 00:14:04,679
who misled the medical examiner

358
00:14:04,679 --> 00:14:06,320
on Wu Qimeng's time of death.

359
00:14:07,039 --> 00:14:07,879
In other words,

360
00:14:09,679 --> 00:14:11,360
you killed your wife.
